/P 108 0 R
/E (The Google Developer Groups at Guelph is launching a brand-new 24-hour hackathon! We are beyond excited to welcome you to the University of Guelph for an adventure day where code meets creativity. Our GDG club began this year as a place for aspiring developers, designers, and tech enthusiasts, and we have grown phenomenally into a community of over 550 members. Our club thrives on the passion and ambition of students like you, who are eager to push the boundaries of what's possible with technology.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
138 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (We're putting a spotlight on fun, learning, and making unforgettable memories at GDGHACKS. Whether you're a novice or a seasoned programmer, our hackathon is the perfect arena to unleash your programming potential and network with peers and industry leaders. Our schedule is packed with engaging workshops, exciting activities, and plenty of opportunities to meet new people and forge lasting connections.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
